{"ID":"20240205153752-ec1bgoa","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240205153752-ec1bgoa","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240205153752-ec1bgoa\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206095238-w1p5zz3\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240607130512-hvwg09t\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:1373,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240619165545-irzx5l7\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:6,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:6\u0026#125;","title":"075地肤子","type":"doc","updated":"20240807175435"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240206095238-w1p5zz3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206095238-w1p5zz3","updated":"20240206095248"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【产地】\t主产于江苏、河南、河北、山东等地。\n【性状】\t呈扁球状五角星形，直径13mm。外被宿存花被，表面灰绿色或浅棕色，周围具膜质小翅5枚，北面中心有微突起的点状果梗痕及放射状脉纹10条；剥离花被，可见膜质果皮，半透明。种子扁卵形，长约1mm，黑色。气微，味微苦。\n【性味】\t辛、苦，寒。\n【功效】\t清热利湿，祛风止痒。用于小便涩痛、阴痒带下、风疹、湿疹、皮肤瘙痒。"}]},{"ID":"20240206095239-juye350","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206095239-juye350","updated":"20240206095239"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240206095239-k2dw7qp.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240205161229-dy64za9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240205161229-dy64za9","updated":"20240205161229"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"地肤子"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/地肤子-20240205161229-vtotik9.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240619165545-irzx5l7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240619165545-irzx5l7","updated":"20240620084724"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 551px;","style":"width: 541px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"地肤子"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/地肤子-20240619165545-2rgc0oy.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 541px;\" parent-style=\"width: 551px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240807175118-ql618gm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240807175118-ql618gm","updated":"20240807175118"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 367px;","style":"width: 357px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"地肤子 (6)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/地肤子 6-20240807172503-di9hnj4.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 357px;\" parent-style=\"width: 367px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 367px;","style":"width: 357px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"地肤子4"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/地肤子4-20240620084724-kkvv22a.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 357px;\" parent-style=\"width: 367px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 520px;","style":"width: 510px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"地肤子 (7)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/地肤子 7-20240807172741-mm1klmu.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 510px;\" parent-style=\"width: 520px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240807175125-73xc4qe","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240807175125-73xc4qe","updated":"20240807175125"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 328px;","style":"width: 318px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"地肤子 (5)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/地肤子 5-20240807172204-fjvcae8.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 318px;\" parent-style=\"width: 328px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 332px;","style":"width: 322px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"地肤子 (4)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/地肤子 4-20240807171856-etsc9fl.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 322px;\" parent-style=\"width: 332px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 329px;","style":"width: 319px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"地肤子 (3)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/地肤子 3-20240807171812-mm3rlhr.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 319px;\" parent-style=\"width: 329px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 329px;","style":"width: 319px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"地肤子 (2)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/地肤子 2-20240807171646-e63ycjr.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 319px;\" parent-style=\"width: 329px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240807171145-hec6jq3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240807171145-hec6jq3","updated":"20240807172528"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 657px;","style":"width: 647px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"地肤子 (1)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/地肤子 1-20240807171144-cmbh1ds.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 647px;\" parent-style=\"width: 657px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 588px;","style":"width: 578px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"地肤子1"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/地肤子1-20240619170151-cgnasw2.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 578px;\" parent-style=\"width: 588px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240619170151-il5vcd7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240619170151-il5vcd7","updated":"20240807175052"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 744px;","style":"width: 734px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"地肤子"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/地肤子-20240620083757-gkyz2z6.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 734px;\" parent-style=\"width: 744px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 498px;","style":"width: 488px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"地肤子 (9)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/地肤子 9-20240807175052-84ocjsf.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 488px;\" parent-style=\"width: 498px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240807175227-dqu3qsk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240807175227-dqu3qsk","updated":"20240807175328"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 549px;","style":"width: 539px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"地肤子 (10)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/地肤子 10-20240807175227-towsbrm.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 539px;\" parent-style=\"width: 549px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 549px;","style":"width: 539px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"地肤子 (11)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/地肤子 11-20240807175328-za41dzb.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 539px;\" parent-style=\"width: 549px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240807172314-d353z3p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240807172314-d353z3p","updated":"20240807175435"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"注：为扫帚苗的种子；（扫帚苗老了以后，在农村经常被用来制作扫帚）"}]},{"ID":"20240807171415-wrk5dw9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240807171415-wrk5dw9","updated":"20240807172313"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"二"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"注：地肤子茎杆有红色和绿色的；"}]},{"ID":"20240616165702-neg6ksr","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240616165702-neg6ksr"}},{"ID":"20240616165733-ggkwtpx","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240616165733-ggkwtpx","updated":"20240616165737"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"地肤子《神农本草经》"}]},{"ID":"20240616165733-ohlcg8s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616165733-ohlcg8s","updated":"20240616165733"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味苦寒。"}]},{"ID":"20240616165733-jalhjkb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616165733-jalhjkb","updated":"20240616165733"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"主旁光热，利小便，补中益精气。久服，耳目聪明，轻身耐老。一名地葵（《御览》引云，一名地华，一名地脉，《大观本》无一名地华四字，脉作麦，皆黑字）。生平泽及田野。"}]},{"ID":"20240616165733-bb7571o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616165733-bb7571o","updated":"20240616165733"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"古医曰：一名地麦，生荆州，八月十月采实，阴干。"}]},{"ID":"20240616165733-cvckofz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616165733-cvckofz","updated":"20240616165733"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"案《广雅》云：地葵，地肤也；《列仙传》云：文宾服地肤；郑樵云：地肤曰落帚，亦曰地扫；《尔雅》云：荓，马帚，即此也，今人亦用为帚。"}]},{"ID":"20240616165702-6j870af","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240616165702-6j870af"}},{"ID":"20240616165722-rwj7jpk","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240616165722-rwj7jpk","updated":"20240616165725"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"地肤子《本草从新》"}]},{"ID":"20240616165722-74tc2fa","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616165722-74tc2fa","updated":"20240616165722"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"通、利水．"}]},{"ID":"20240616165722-e3tu9op","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616165722-e3tu9op","updated":"20240616165722"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"甘苦而寒．入膀胱．除虚热．利小便而通淋．（时珍曰∶无阴则阳无以化、亦犹东垣治小便不通、用知 滋肾之意、王节斋云∶小便不禁或频数、古方多以为寒、而用温涩之药、殊不知属热者多、盖膀胱火邪妄动、水不得宁、故不能禁而频数也、老人多频数、由膀胱血少、阳火偏旺也、治法当补膀胱阴血、泻火邪为主、而佐以收涩之剂、如牡蛎山茱北味之类、补血泻火、治其本也、收之涩之、治其标也．）治 疝．散恶疮．（煎汤、洗疮疥良．）叶作浴汤．去皮肤风热丹肿．洗眼．除雀盲涩痛．叶如蒿．茎赤．子类蚕砂．恶螵蛸．（胁下疼痛、地肤子末、酒服方寸匕．）"}]},{"ID":"20240616165702-lb9nkv6","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240616165702-lb9nkv6"}},{"ID":"20240616165712-or573cc","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240616165712-or573cc","updated":"20240616165716"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"地肤子《本草经集注》"}]},{"ID":"20240616165712-p4uial4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616165712-p4uial4","updated":"20240616165712"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味苦，寒，无毒。主治膀胱热，利小便，补中，益精气。去皮肤中热气，散恶疮疝瘕，强阴。久服耳目聪明，轻身，耐老，使人润泽。一名地葵，一名地麦。生荆州平泽及田野。"}]},{"ID":"20240616165712-hbbt4nk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616165712-hbbt4nk","updated":"20240616165712"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"八月、十月采实，阴干。"}]},{"ID":"20240616165712-fmmyn47","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616165712-fmmyn47","updated":"20240616165712"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"今田野间亦多，皆取茎苗为扫帚。子微细，入补丸、散用，《仙经》不甚须。"}]},{"ID":"20240616165913-qnyw7aq","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240616165913-qnyw7aq"}},{"ID":"20240616165914-concu53","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240616165914-concu53","updated":"20240616165922"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"地肤子《证类本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240616165914-gqgcint","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616165914-gqgcint","updated":"20240616165916"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味苦，寒，无毒。主膀胱热，利小便，补中益精气，去皮肤中热气，散恶疮疝瘕，强阴。久服耳目聪明，轻身耐老，使人润泽。一名地葵，一名地麦。生荆州平泽及田野。八月、十月采实，阴干。"}]},{"ID":"20240616165914-92h01s7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616165914-92h01s7","updated":"20240616165914"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"陶隐居云∶今田野间亦多，皆取茎苗为扫帚。子微细，入补丸散用，《仙经》不甚须。"}]},{"ID":"20240616165914-p73jznt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616165914-p73jznt","updated":"20240616165914"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"唐本注云∶地肤子，田野人名为地麦草，叶细茎赤。多出熟田中。苗极弱，不能胜举。今云堪为扫帚，恐人未识之。《别录》云∶捣绞取汁，主赤白痢，洗目去热，暗雀盲涩痛。苗灰，主痢亦善。北人亦名涎衣草。臣禹锡等谨按蜀本图经云∶叶细茎赤，初生薄地，花黄白，子青白色，今所在有。药性论云∶地肤子，君。一名益明。与阳起石同服，主丈夫阴痿不起，补气益力，治阴卵 疾，去热风，可作汤沐浴。日华子云∶治客热，丹肿。又名落帚子。色青，似一眠起蚕沙矣。"}]},{"ID":"20240616165914-aumhy2j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616165914-aumhy2j","updated":"20240616165914"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"图经曰∶地肤子，生荆州平泽及田野，今蜀川、关中近地皆有之。初生薄地五、六寸，根形如蒿，茎赤叶青，大似荆芥。三月开黄白花，八月、九月采实，阴干用。神仙七精散云∶地肤子，星之精也。或曰其苗即独扫也，一名鸭舌草。陶隐居谓茎苗可为扫帚者。苏恭云∶苗极弱，不能胜举。二说不同，而今医家便以为独扫是也。密州所上者，其说益明。云根作丛生，每窠有二、三十茎，茎有赤有黄，七月开黄花，其实地肤也。至八月而 秆成，可采，正与此地独扫相类。若然，恐西北所出者短弱，故苏注云尔。其叶味苦，寒，无毒。主大肠泄泻，止赤白痢，和气，涩肠胃，解恶疮毒。三、四月、五月采。"}]},{"ID":"20240616165914-74mdnah","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616165914-74mdnah","updated":"20240616165914"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"外台秘要∶治目痛及眯忽中伤，因有热暝者。取地肤子白汁注目中。又方∶疗手足烦疼。"}]},{"ID":"20240616165914-d76xtna","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616165914-d76xtna","updated":"20240616165914"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"地肤草三两，水四升，煮取二升半。分三服，日一剂。肘后方∶治积年久 腰痛，有时发动。六月、七月取地肤子干末，酒服方寸匕，日五、六服。子母秘录治妊娠患淋，小便数，去少，忽热痛酸索，手足疼烦。地肤子十二两，初以水四升，煎取二升半，分温三服。杨氏产乳∶疗小便数多，或热痛酸楚，手足烦疼。地肤草三两，以水四升，煮取二升半，分三服。"}]},{"ID":"20240616165903-yach5xl","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240616165903-yach5xl"}},{"ID":"20240616165904-uwgxyh2","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240616165904-uwgxyh2","updated":"20240616165907"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"地肤子《新修本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240616165904-jnr337e","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616165904-jnr337e","updated":"20240616165904"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味苦，寒，无毒。主膀胱热，利小便，补中，益精气，去皮肤中热气，散恶疮疝瘕，强阴。久服耳目聪明，轻身耐老，使人润泽。一名地葵，一名地麦。生荆州平泽及田野。八月、十月采实，阴干。"}]},{"ID":"20240616165904-55w1s1z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616165904-55w1s1z","updated":"20240616165904"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"今田野间亦多，皆取茎苗为扫帚。子微细，入补丸散用。《仙经》不甚须。"}]},{"ID":"20240616165904-8ihfut7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616165904-8ihfut7","updated":"20240616165904"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"〔谨案〕地肤子，田野人名为地麦草，叶细茎赤，多出熟田中，苗极弱，不能胜举。今云堪为扫帚，恐人未识之。《别录》云∶捣绞取汁，主赤白痢，洗目，去热暗、雀盲、涩痛。苗灰，主痢亦善。北人亦名涎衣草。"}]},{"ID":"20240616165852-3hsouhe","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240616165852-3hsouhe"}},{"ID":"20240616165853-cupp74l","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240616165853-cupp74l","updated":"20240616165858"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"地肤子《本经逢原》"}]},{"ID":"20240616165853-fnt63o6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616165853-fnt63o6","updated":"20240616165853"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"一名落帚，又名黄蒿"}]},{"ID":"20240616165853-5mc0xt9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616165853-5mc0xt9","updated":"20240616165853"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"甘寒，无毒。"}]},{"ID":"20240616165853-z5t27nz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616165853-z5t27nz","updated":"20240616165853"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《本经》主膀胱热，利小便，补中益气。久服耳目聪明，轻身不老。"}]},{"ID":"20240616165853-kts9li0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616165853-kts9li0","updated":"20240616165853"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"发明"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"众病皆起于虚，虚而多热，则小便不利，精气日燔，故《本经》主以清利膀胱热邪，中气自复，耳目聪明矣。其能祛热，利小便，去阴火，治客热丹肿。叶主老人夏秋间热淋，用此捣自然汁服之即通。男子白浊用地肤子、白敛为丸滚汤下。妇人白带地肤子为末，热酒服之，屡效。苗叶烧灰煎霜，制砒石粉霜、水银、硫黄、雄黄、 砂毒。"}]},{"ID":"20240616165841-gouk68m","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240616165841-gouk68m"}},{"ID":"20240616165842-yni6z3g","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240616165842-yni6z3g","updated":"20240616165848"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"地肤子《得配本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240616165842-4xxuvii","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616165842-4xxuvii","updated":"20240616165842"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"苦、甘，寒。入足太阳经气分。利膀胱水，去皮肤热。除客热丹肿，疗 疝溲数，煎洗一切疮疥。得生地，治风热赤眼。得甘草，治虚热。配生姜、热酒，治雷头风肿。佐地榆、黄芩，治血痢。佐白术、肉桂，治狐疝阴 。（忌生葱、桃、李。）"}]},{"ID":"20240616165842-96tg8hl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616165842-96tg8hl","updated":"20240616165842"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"叶，苦、寒。煎汤洗浴，去皮间风热。频洗眼，除雀盲涩痛。"}]},{"ID":"20240616165842-v2o69bn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616165842-v2o69bn","updated":"20240616165842"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"捣汁服，治泄泻淋症。"}]},{"ID":"20240616165831-bvrdhpw","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240616165831-bvrdhpw"}},{"ID":"20240616165832-u86c4d8","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240616165832-u86c4d8","updated":"20240616165837"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"地肤子《本草撮要》"}]},{"ID":"20240616165832-xtg47ja","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616165832-xtg47ja","updated":"20240616165832"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味甘苦气寒．入足太阳经．功专益精强阴．入膀胱．除虚热．利小便而通淋．治疝．散恶疮．叶作浴汤．去皮肤风热丹肿．洗眼除雀盲涩痛．恶螵蛸．胁下疼痛．地肤子末酒服良．"}]},{"ID":"20240616165822-tjyx30i","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240616165822-tjyx30i"}},{"ID":"20240616165823-i30yp7k","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240616165823-i30yp7k","updated":"20240616165827"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"地肤子《冯氏锦囊秘录》"}]},{"ID":"20240616165823-jvi6iec","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616165823-jvi6iec","updated":"20240616165823"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味苦寒，无毒。入脾经。"}]},{"ID":"20240616165823-mo0otoo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616165823-mo0otoo","updated":"20240616165823"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"地肤子，专利水道，去膀胱热，浴身却皮肤搔痒热疹，洗眼除热，暗雀盲涩痛。"}]},{"ID":"20240616165823-ic9p9ew","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616165823-ic9p9ew","updated":"20240616165823"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"主治（痘疹合参） 主膀胱热，利小便，去皮肤中热，兼解痘毒。"}]},{"ID":"20240616165823-tk5c64n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616165823-tk5c64n","updated":"20240616165823"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"按∶地肤子，气味苦寒，得太阳寒水气化，太阳之气，上及九天，下彻九泉，外弥肤胜，故能上治头而聪耳明目，下入膀胱而利水去疝，外去皮肤热气，而令润泽也。"}]},{"ID":"20240616165810-ipvbgik","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240616165810-ipvbgik"}},{"ID":"20240616165811-8z74kz0","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240616165811-8z74kz0","updated":"20240616165815"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"地肤子《本草备要》"}]},{"ID":"20240616165811-6dhxoco","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616165811-6dhxoco","updated":"20240616165811"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"通，利水，补阴"}]},{"ID":"20240616165811-b1mhuxz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616165811-b1mhuxz","updated":"20240616165811"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"甘苦气寒。益精强阴，入膀胱，除虚热，利小便而通淋（时珍曰∶无阴则阳无以化，亦犹东垣治小便不通，用知、柏滋肾之意。王节斋曰∶小便不禁或频数，古方多以为寒，而用温涩之药。殊不知属热者多，盖膀胱火邪妄动，水不得宁，故不能禁而频数也。故老人多频数，是膀胱血少，阳火偏旺也。治法当补膀胱阴血，泻火邪为主，而佐以收涩之剂，如牡蛎、山茱、五味之类，不可独用。病本属热，故宜泻火。因水不足，故火动而致便数，小便既多，水益虚矣，故宜补血。补血泻火，治其本也。收之涩之，治其标也）。"}]},{"ID":"20240616165811-zpzacg4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616165811-zpzacg4","updated":"20240616165811"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"治 疝，散恶疮（煎汤，洗疮疥良）。叶作浴汤，去皮肤风热丹肿，洗眼除雀盲涩痛。"}]},{"ID":"20240616165811-vjvvcbr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616165811-vjvvcbr","updated":"20240616165811"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"叶如蒿，茎赤，子类蚕砂。恶螵蛸。"}]},{"ID":"20240616165755-kersmiq","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240616165755-kersmiq"}},{"ID":"20240616165756-lbqmgef","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240616165756-lbqmgef","updated":"20240616165802"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"地肤子《本草图经》"}]},{"ID":"20240616165756-a74mxmh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616165756-a74mxmh","updated":"20240616165804"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"地肤子"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，生荆州平泽及田野，今蜀川、关中近地皆有之。初生薄地，五、六寸；根形如蒿，茎赤，叶青，大似荆芥；三月开黄白花。八月、九月采实，阴干用。神仙七精散云∶地肤子，星之精也。或曰其苗即独扫也，一名鸭舌草。陶隐居谓∶茎苗可为扫帚者。苏恭云∶苗极弱，不能胜举。二说不同。而今医家便以为独扫是也。密州所上者，其说益明。云根作丛生，每窠有二、三十茎，茎有赤有黄，七月开黄花，其实地肤也。至八月而秸秆成，可采，正与此地独扫相类。若然，恐西北所出者短弱，故苏注云尔。其叶味苦，寒，无毒。主大肠泄泻，止赤白痢，和气，涩肠胃，解恶疮毒。三月、四月、五月采。"}]},{"ID":"20240616165744-qghur3w","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240616165744-qghur3w"}},{"ID":"20240616165745-t9dcwk9","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240616165745-t9dcwk9","updated":"20240616165750"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"地肤子《药鉴》"}]},{"ID":"20240616165745-a5m64co","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616165745-a5m64co","updated":"20240616165745"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"气寒，味苦，无毒。专利水道，去热膀胱。浴身却皮肤瘙痒热疹，洗眼除热暗雀盲涩疼。"}]},{"ID":"20240616165745-r95exz4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616165745-r95exz4","updated":"20240616165745"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"叶捣绞汁服之，又解诸恶疮毒。泄泻分渗，血痢无驱。四肢浮肿堪消，头面湿肿可除。其曰益精强阴，明目聪耳，误矣。盖此剂寒苦，但主走泄而不能守。既曰走而不守，则精其亏矣，又何益乎？阴其损矣，又何强乎？阴损精亏，则阴精不得以上荣，而阳火反得以上亢矣。耳目聋昏则有之，耳目聪明诚无也。"}]},{"ID":"20240616165702-eyh39t4","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240616165702-eyh39t4"}},{"ID":"20240616165703-r5f9zpj","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240616165703-r5f9zpj","updated":"20240616165707"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"地肤子《千金翼方》"}]},{"ID":"20240616165703-ny7us5l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616165703-ny7us5l","updated":"20240616165703"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味苦，寒，无毒。主膀胱热，利小便，补中，益精气，去皮肤中热气，散恶疮疝瘕，强阴。久服耳目聪明，轻身耐老，使人润泽。一名地葵，一名地麦。生荆州平泽及田野，八月十月采实，阴干。"}]},{"ID":"20240616165542-80tcvqp","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240616165542-80tcvqp"}},{"ID":"20240616165634-is4olat","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240616165634-is4olat","updated":"20240616165638"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"地肤子《名医别录》"}]},{"ID":"20240616165634-4s0zk8g","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616165634-4s0zk8g","updated":"20240616165634"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"无毒．主去皮肤中热气，散恶疮疝瘕，强阴．久服使人润泽．一名地麦．生荆州及田八月、十月采实，阴干．又，地肤子，捣绞取汁，主赤白痢；洗目去热暗，雀盲、涩痛．苗灰，主痢亦善．"}]},{"ID":"20240616165542-f7049hf","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240616165542-f7049hf"}},{"ID":"20240616165622-63j0ge0","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240616165622-63j0ge0","updated":"20240616165626"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"地肤子《本草乘雅半偈》"}]},{"ID":"20240616165622-pdo7d8j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616165622-pdo7d8j","updated":"20240616165622"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（本经上品）"}]},{"ID":"20240616165622-upnyt99","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616165622-upnyt99","updated":"20240616165622"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"地性坚固，肤居肌表。"}]},{"ID":"20240616165622-vsh1rir","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616165622-vsh1rir","updated":"20240616165622"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【气味】苦寒，无毒。"}]},{"ID":"20240616165622-ol05oko","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616165622-ol05oko","updated":"20240616165622"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【主治】主膀胱热，利小便，补中益精气。久服耳目聪明，轻身耐老。"}]},{"ID":"20240616165622-b8fts3y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616165622-b8fts3y","updated":"20240616165622"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【核】曰∶出荆州平泽，及田野间，近道亦有。初生薄地，五六寸，一科数十枝，蓬起蔓延，弱不胜举。根亦如蒿，茎叶皆青，宛如荆芥。三月开淡黄花，结子青白色，极繁盛似头眠蚕沙状，子落茎老，可以为拂，故一名落帚、独帚、王帚、王彗、扫帚、地葵、地麦、白地草、涎地衣、鸭舌草、千心妓女。其苗叶烧灰，煎霜制砒石、粉霜、水银、硫黄、 砂。"}]},{"ID":"20240616165622-61ky4ch","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616165622-61ky4ch","updated":"20240616165622"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"先人题药云∶地肤子，一干数十枝，攒簇直上，其子繁多，星之精也。其味苦寒，得太阳寒水气化，盖太阳之气，上及九天，下彻九泉，外弥肤腠。故地肤之功，上治头，而聪耳明目，下入膀胱而利水去疝，外去皮肤热气，而令润泽。服之病去，必小水通长为外征也。"}]},{"ID":"20240616165622-6tnnquc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616165622-6tnnquc","updated":"20240616165622"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【 】曰∶蔓延敷布，弱不胜举，因名地肤。主治功力，真能使吾身生气敷布在表，有宣义，有开义，当入太阳，太阳为开故也。气味苦寒，亦得太阳寒水之化，故可对待太阳阳象之标，则凡以热为本者，莫不相宜。膀胱，太阳经也，标盛则热，与得寒水之化者逆治之，热谢而小便澄彻矣。补中者，中补乃能敷布。益精气者，益精乃能化气。盖膀胱者，州都之官，津液藏焉，气化则能出矣。聪明耳目，轻身耐老者，以开展则窍通，窍通则充实光辉矣。"}]},{"ID":"20240616165542-ddndki0","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240616165542-ddndki0"}},{"ID":"20240616165543-z9jhdov","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240616165543-z9jhdov","updated":"20240616165547"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"地肤子《本草择要纲目》"}]},{"ID":"20240616165543-fj8e7a8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616165543-fj8e7a8","updated":"20240616165543"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【气味】"}]},{"ID":"20240616165543-qkjiko1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616165543-qkjiko1","updated":"20240616165543"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"苦寒无毒．"}]},{"ID":"20240616165543-qymg5r1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616165543-qymg5r1","updated":"20240616165543"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【主治】"}]},{"ID":"20240616165543-95actfs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616165543-95actfs","updated":"20240616165543"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"膀胱热．利小便中益精气．久服耳目聪明．轻身耐老．去皮肤中热气．使人润泽．散恶疮疝瘕．强阴．治阴卵 疾．去热风．可作汤沐浴．与阳起石同服．主丈夫阴痿不起．补气益力．夫众病皆起于虚．虚而多热者．加地肤子甘草．"}]},{"ID":"20240616165543-0lyn0a4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616165543-0lyn0a4","updated":"20240616165543"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【苗叶】"}]},{"ID":"20240616165543-v9qjb8g","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616165543-v9qjb8g","updated":"20240616165543"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【气味】"}]},{"ID":"20240616165543-piw0otf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616165543-piw0otf","updated":"20240616165543"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"苦寒无毒．"}]},{"ID":"20240616165543-y9aqv5f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616165543-y9aqv5f","updated":"20240616165543"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【主治】"}]},{"ID":"20240616165543-co85xlv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616165543-co85xlv","updated":"20240616165543"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"捣汁服．主赤白痢．烧灰亦善．煎水洗目．去热暗雀盲涩痛．主大肠泄泻．和气涩肠胃．解恶疮毒．煎水日服．治手足烦疼．利小便诸淋．"}]},{"ID":"20240607130512-auubw22","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240607130512-auubw22"}},{"ID":"20240616165528-6377emj","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240616165528-6377emj","updated":"20240616165533"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"地肤子《本草征要》"}]},{"ID":"20240616165528-5fwesqm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616165528-5fwesqm","updated":"20240616165528"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味苦，性寒，无毒。入脾、膀胱二经。"}]},{"ID":"20240616165528-kluldv7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616165528-kluldv7","updated":"20240616165528"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"利膀胱，散恶疮。皮肤风热，可作浴汤。"}]},{"ID":"20240616165528-h4kdhkr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616165528-h4kdhkr","updated":"20240616165528"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"其主用多在皮肤。其入亦在土脏，盖脾主肌肤也。即其利水兼能祛湿者欤。"}]},{"ID":"20240616165254-mx428xe","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240616165254-mx428xe"}},{"ID":"20240616165513-faqyln6","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240616165513-faqyln6","updated":"20240616165520"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"地肤子《本草蒙筌》"}]},{"ID":"20240616165513-pmdvtd0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616165513-pmdvtd0","updated":"20240616165513"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（一名落帚子。） 味苦，气寒。无毒。生于平泽中，苗名铁扫帚。叶如荆芥，子类蚕沙。秋末采收，阴干入药。专利水道，去热膀胱。多服益精强阴，久服明目聪耳。浴身却皮肤瘙痒热疹，洗眼除热暗雀盲涩疼。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"叶"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"捣绞汁服之，又散诸恶疮毒。泄泻分渗，血痢兼驱。"}]},{"ID":"20240616165254-7q7x11x","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240616165254-7q7x11x"}},{"ID":"20240616165454-kcdkg4b","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240616165454-kcdkg4b","updated":"20240616165506"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"地肤子《增广和剂局方药性总论》"}]},{"ID":"20240616165454-8hp0vpz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616165454-8hp0vpz","updated":"20240616165454"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味苦，寒，无毒。主膀胱热，利便，补中，益精气，去皮肤中热气，散恶疮，疝瘕阴。《药性论》云∶君。与阳起石同服主丈夫阴痿不起，补气益力，治阴卵 疾，可作汤浴。日华子云∶治客热，丹毒。一云∶治妊娠患淋，小便数。"}]},{"ID":"20240616165254-vteldzw","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240616165254-vteldzw"}},{"ID":"20240616165445-nckosnr","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240616165445-nckosnr","updated":"20240616165449"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"地肤子《医学入门》"}]},{"ID":"20240616165445-7gzn4gz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616165445-7gzn4gz","updated":"20240616165445"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"地肤子苦利膀胱，治瘕疝兮又兴阳，皮风目痛皆堪洗，叶主淋痢及疮疡。"}]},{"ID":"20240616165445-r6tdjkz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616165445-r6tdjkz","updated":"20240616165445"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"苗弱不举，布地而生。堪为扫蒂。气寒。无毒。主膀胱热，利小便，疗疝瘕，补中强阴益精。本草云∶与阳起石同用，治丈夫阴痿及阴卵溃疾。煎汤洗皮肤中风热，令人润泽；洗目去热暗雀盲涩痛。叶主大肠泄泻，止赤白痢和气涩肠，解恶疮毒，客热丹肿及妊娠患淋，小便热痛，手中烦疼。形如蒿，茎赤叶青，大如荆芥。"}]},{"ID":"20240616165445-40ji55a","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616165445-40ji55a","updated":"20240616165445"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"十月采实阴干，入补丸。"}]},{"ID":"20240616165254-j78n1oc","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240616165254-j78n1oc"}},{"ID":"20240616165435-akiabmq","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240616165435-akiabmq","updated":"20240616165440"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"地肤子《本草求真》"}]},{"ID":"20240616165435-4gem9t3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616165435-4gem9t3","updated":"20240616165435"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（隰草）泻膀胱血虚湿热利小便淋闭"}]},{"ID":"20240616165435-m3oy5sg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616165435-m3oy5sg","updated":"20240616165435"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"地肤子（专入膀胱）。治淋利水清热。功颇类于黄柏。但黄柏其味苦烈。此则味苦而甘。黄柏大泻膀胱湿热。此则其力稍逊。凡小便因热而见频数及或不禁。用此苦以入阴。寒以胜热。而使湿热尽从小便而出也。（频数既谓之热。则不禁当不得以热名。然不禁亦有因于膀胱邪火妄动而致者。但频数不禁出于体旺。则为阳火偏胜。用以实治则可。出于虚衰老弱。虽有邪火内炽。亦恐真阳不足。当为详慎。）但虚火偏旺而热得恣。固当用以清利。若不佐以补味同入。则小水既利而血益虚。血虚则热益生。热生而淋其益甚矣。故宜佐以牡蛎山药五味收涩之剂。俾清者清。补者补。通者通。涩者涩。滋润条达而无偏胜为害之弊矣！且能以治因热 疝。并煎汤以治疮疥。至书所谓益精强阴。非是具有补益之能。不过因其热除。而即具有坚强之意耳。类蚕沙。恶螵蛸。（藏器曰。众病皆起于虚。虚而多热者。加地肤子甘草。）"}]},{"ID":"20240607130519-gvh7f7u","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240607130519-gvh7f7u"}},{"ID":"20240607130512-rij7wk8","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240607130512-rij7wk8","updated":"20240607130512"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《中国药典》：地肤子"}]},{"ID":"20240607130512-rjp550c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607130512-rjp550c","updated":"20240607130512"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拼音注音"}]},{"ID":"20240607130512-i6itf1b","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607130512-i6itf1b","updated":"20240607130512"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Dì Fū Zǐ"}]},{"ID":"20240607130512-oxjywuw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607130512-oxjywuw","updated":"20240607130512"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"别名"}]},{"ID":"20240607130512-rlrmamj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607130512-rlrmamj","updated":"20240607130512"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 扫帚苗"}]},{"ID":"20240607130512-9q97j0t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607130512-9q97j0t","updated":"20240607130512"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"英文名"}]},{"ID":"20240607130512-0x7epv0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607130512-0x7epv0","updated":"20240607130512"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" FRUCTUS KOCHIAE"}]},{"ID":"20240607130512-v3c3lyc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607130512-v3c3lyc","updated":"20240607130512"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"来源"}]},{"ID":"20240607130512-ij3gita","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607130512-ij3gita","updated":"20240607130512"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 本品为藜科植物"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"地肤"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Kochia scoparia （L.） Schrad.的干燥"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"成熟果实"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。秋季果实成熟时采收植株，晒干，打下果实，除去杂质。"}]},{"ID":"20240607130512-m8j951u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607130512-m8j951u","updated":"20240607130512"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性状"}]},{"ID":"20240607130512-cieumzd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607130512-cieumzd","updated":"20240607130512"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 本品呈扁球状五角星形，直径1～3mm。外被宿存花被，表面灰绿色或浅棕色，周围具膜质小翅5枚，背面中心有微突起的点状果梗痕及放射状脉纹5～10条；剥离花被，可见膜质果皮，半透明。种子扁卵形，约1mm,黑色。气微，味微苦。"}]},{"ID":"20240607130512-5wzdi0w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607130512-5wzdi0w","updated":"20240607130512"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"贮藏"}]},{"ID":"20240607130512-hvwg09t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607130512-hvwg09t","updated":"20240607130512"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 置通风干燥处，防蛀。"}]},{"ID":"20240607130512-cwyf30z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607130512-cwyf30z","updated":"20240607130512"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"鉴别"}]},{"ID":"20240607130512-kce582h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607130512-kce582h","updated":"20240607130512"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" （1） 本品粉末棕褐色。花被表皮细胞多角形，气孔不定式，薄壁细胞中含草酸钙簇晶。果皮细胞呈类长方形或多边形，壁薄，波状弯曲，含众多草酸钙小方晶。种皮细胞棕褐色，呈多角形或类方形，多皱缩。"}]},{"ID":"20240607130512-vi45aoo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607130512-vi45aoo","updated":"20240607130512"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（2） 取本品粉末2g，加乙醇20ml，盐酸1.5ml,加热回流2 小时，滤过，滤液浓缩至约5ml,加水10ml，混匀，置分液漏斗中，加石油醚（60～90℃）20ml振摇提取，分取醚液，蒸干，残渣加乙醇2ml 使溶解，作为供试品溶液。另取齐墩果酸对照品，加乙醇制成每1ml含1mg的溶液，作为对照品溶液。照薄层色谱法（附录Ⅵ B）试验。吸取上述供试品溶液2μl、对照品溶液4μl，分别点于同一以羧甲基纤维素钠为黏合剂的硅胶Ｈ薄层板上,以氯仿－甲醇（40:1）为展开剂，展开，取出，晾干，喷以磷钼酸试液，在105℃加热至斑点显色清晰。供试品色谱中，在与对照品色谱相应的位置上，显相同颜色的斑点。"}]},{"ID":"20240607130512-rk34tpy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607130512-rk34tpy","updated":"20240607130512"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"归经"}]},{"ID":"20240607130512-96zijiw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607130512-96zijiw","updated":"20240607130512"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 归肾、膀胱经。"}]},{"ID":"20240607130512-8o17nfr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607130512-8o17nfr","updated":"20240607130512"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性味"}]},{"ID":"20240607130512-vysc9py","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607130512-vysc9py","updated":"20240607130512"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 辛、苦，寒。"}]},{"ID":"20240607130512-hav8bvg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607130512-hav8bvg","updated":"20240607130512"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"功能主治"}]},{"ID":"20240607130512-odow878","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607130512-odow878","updated":"20240607130512"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 清热利湿，祛风止痒。用于小便涩痛，阴痒带下，风疹，湿疹，皮肤瘙痒。"}]},{"ID":"20240607130512-n46dl45","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607130512-n46dl45","updated":"20240607130512"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"用法用量"}]},{"ID":"20240607130512-iu6led7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607130512-iu6led7","updated":"20240607130512"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 9～15g。外用适量，煎汤熏洗。"}]},{"ID":"20240607130512-w1xwjdc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607130512-w1xwjdc","updated":"20240607130512"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"摘录"}]},{"ID":"20240607130512-l8pg3zk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607130512-l8pg3zk","updated":"20240607130512"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《中国药典》"}]},{"ID":"20240607130512-vom7dl3","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240607130512-vom7dl3","updated":"20240607130512"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《中药大辞典》：地肤子"}]},{"ID":"20240607130512-zjzcy3g","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607130512-zjzcy3g","updated":"20240607130512"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拼音注音"}]},{"ID":"20240607130512-4hzjtui","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607130512-4hzjtui","updated":"20240607130512"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Dì Fū Zǐ"}]},{"ID":"20240607130512-njriha5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607130512-njriha5","updated":"20240607130512"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"别名"}]},{"ID":"20240607130512-ri04thr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607130512-ri04thr","updated":"20240607130512"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 地葵（《本经》），地麦（《别录》），益明（《药性论》），落帚子（《日华子本草》），竹帚子（《滇南本草》），千头子（《万病回春》），帚菜子（《新疆药材》），铁扫把子（《四川中药志》）。"}]},{"ID":"20240607130512-j4hagom","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607130512-j4hagom","updated":"20240607130512"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"出处"}]},{"ID":"20240607130512-mmjbjt1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607130512-mmjbjt1","updated":"20240607130512"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《本经》"}]},{"ID":"20240607130512-3of3csv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607130512-3of3csv","updated":"20240607130512"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"来源"}]},{"ID":"20240607130512-03qe547","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607130512-03qe547","updated":"20240607130512"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 为藜科植物"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"地肤"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"的"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"果实"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。秋季果实成熟时割取全草，晒干，打下果实，除净枝、叶等杂质。"}]},{"ID":"20240607130512-khdsfnv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607130512-khdsfnv","updated":"20240607130512"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生境分布"}]},{"ID":"20240607130512-jx6vwzi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607130512-jx6vwzi","updated":"20240607130512"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 生长于山野荒地、田野、路旁，栽培于庭园。分布黑龙江、吉林、辽宁、河北、山东、山西、陕西、河南、安徽、江苏、甘肃等地。各地多有栽培。主产河北、山西、山东、河南等地。此外，辽宁、青海、陕西、甘肃、四川、江苏、安徽等地亦产。"}]},{"ID":"20240607130512-c00la7z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607130512-c00la7z","updated":"20240607130512"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"原形态"}]},{"ID":"20240607130512-dxhn3e4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607130512-dxhn3e4","updated":"20240607130512"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 地肤（《本经》），又名：箭、王蔧（《尔雅》），王帚（《尔雅》郭璞注），扫帚（陶弘景），涎衣草（《唐本草》），鸭舌草、独帚（《本草图经》），白地草（《纲目》），黄蒿（《本经逢原》），地面草。"}]},{"ID":"20240607130512-qt7udgi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607130512-qt7udgi","updated":"20240607130512"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"一年生草本，高约50～150厘米。茎直立，多分枝，绿色，秋季常变为红色，幼枝有白柔毛。叶互生，无柄；狭披针形至线状披针形，长1～7厘米，宽1～7毫米，先端渐尖，基部楔形，全缘，上面绿色，无毛，下面淡绿色，无毛或有短柔毛；幼叶边缘有白色长柔毛，其后逐渐脱落。花1朵或数朵生于叶腋，成穗状花序；花小，黄绿色；花被筒状，先端5齿裂，裂片三角形，向内弯曲，包裹子房，中肋突起似龙骨状，裂片背部有一绿色突起物；雄蕊5，伸出于花被之外；子房上位，扁圆形，花柱极短，柱头2。胞果扁圆形，基部有宿存花被，展开成5权横生的翅。种子1枚，扁球形，黑色。花期7～9月。果期8～10月。"}]},{"ID":"20240607130512-jzykoov","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607130512-jzykoov","updated":"20240607130512"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性状"}]},{"ID":"20240607130512-axls2e6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607130512-axls2e6","updated":"20240607130512"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 干燥果实呈扁圆形五角星状，直径1～3毫米，厚约1毫米。外面为宿存花被，膜质，先端5裂，裂片三角形，土灰绿色或浅棕色；有的具三角形小翅5枚，排列如五角星状。顶面中央有柱头残痕，基部有圆点状果柄痕，及10条左右放射状的棱线。花被易剥离，内有1粒小坚果，横生，果皮半透明膜质，有点状花纹，亦易剥离，种子褐棕色，扁平，形似芝麻，在扩大镜下，可见表面有点状花纹，中部稍凹，边缘稍隆起，内有马蹄状的胚，淡黄色，油质，胚乳白色。气微，味微苦。以色灰绿。饱满、无枝叶杂质者为佳。"}]},{"ID":"20240607130512-43igurc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607130512-43igurc","updated":"20240607130512"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"化学成分"}]},{"ID":"20240607130512-c6dohlr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607130512-c6dohlr","updated":"20240607130512"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 种子含三萜皂甙、油15％。绿色部分含生物碱。"}]},{"ID":"20240607130512-zkwhb05","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607130512-zkwhb05","updated":"20240607130512"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"药理作用"}]},{"ID":"20240607130512-e1suofa","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607130512-e1suofa","updated":"20240607130512"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 水浸剂（1：3）在试管内对许兰氏黄癣菌，奥杜盎氏小芽胞癣菌等皮肤真菌有抑制作用。对大鼠无利尿作用。"}]},{"ID":"20240607130512-k50m5yx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607130512-k50m5yx","updated":"20240607130512"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"归经"}]},{"ID":"20240607130512-e7gtd6q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607130512-e7gtd6q","updated":"20240607130512"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 入肾、膀胱经。"}]},{"ID":"20240607130512-fnviewr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607130512-fnviewr","updated":"20240607130512"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①卢复：\"入膀胱。\""}]},{"ID":"20240607130512-audz6kv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607130512-audz6kv","updated":"20240607130512"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《要药分剂》：\"入肾、膀胱二经。\""}]},{"ID":"20240607130512-vthc5hk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607130512-vthc5hk","updated":"20240607130512"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性味"}]},{"ID":"20240607130512-070mehb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607130512-070mehb","updated":"20240607130512"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 甘苦，寒。"}]},{"ID":"20240607130512-95hwf2a","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607130512-95hwf2a","updated":"20240607130512"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《本经》：\"味苦，寒。\""}]},{"ID":"20240607130512-uiopblr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607130512-uiopblr","updated":"20240607130512"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《别录》：\"无毒。\""}]},{"ID":"20240607130512-nt1yj78","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607130512-nt1yj78","updated":"20240607130512"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③《纲目》：\"甘，寒。\""}]},{"ID":"20240607130512-66t749b","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607130512-66t749b","updated":"20240607130512"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"注意"}]},{"ID":"20240607130512-yqliary","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607130512-yqliary","updated":"20240607130512"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《本草备要》：\"恶螵蛸。\""}]},{"ID":"20240607130512-3f6tm8z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607130512-3f6tm8z","updated":"20240607130512"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"功能主治"}]},{"ID":"20240607130512-kz6lxix","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607130512-kz6lxix","updated":"20240607130512"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 利小便，清湿热。治小便不利，淋病，带下，疝气，风疹，疮毒，疥癣，阴部湿痒。"}]},{"ID":"20240607130512-lyor3ls","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607130512-lyor3ls","updated":"20240607130512"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《本经》：\"主膀胱热，利小便。补中，益精气。\""}]},{"ID":"20240607130512-e1b8yvd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607130512-e1b8yvd","updated":"20240607130512"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《别录》：\"去皮肤中热气，散恶疮，疝瘕，强阴，使人润泽。\""}]},{"ID":"20240607130512-j6w7qq2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607130512-j6w7qq2","updated":"20240607130512"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③《药性论》：\"与阳起石同服，主丈夫阴痿不起，补气益力；治阴卵癀疾，去热风，可作汤沐浴。\""}]},{"ID":"20240607130512-kc1ax0z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607130512-kc1ax0z","updated":"20240607130512"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"④《日华子本草》：\"治客热丹肿。\""}]},{"ID":"20240607130512-mzmo0v9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607130512-mzmo0v9","updated":"20240607130512"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑤《滇南本草》：\"利膀胱小便积热，洗皮肤之风，疗妇人诸经客热，清利胎热，湿热带下。\""}]},{"ID":"20240607130512-biozu9c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607130512-biozu9c","updated":"20240607130512"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑥《本草原始》：\"去皮肤中积热，除皮肤外湿痒。\""}]},{"ID":"20240607130512-5quwyfc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607130512-5quwyfc","updated":"20240607130512"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑦《本草备要》：\"益精强阴，除虚热，利小便而通淋。\""}]},{"ID":"20240607130512-38n1vv9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607130512-38n1vv9","updated":"20240607130512"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑧《玉楸药解》：\"疗头目肿痛，狐疝阴颓，腰疼胁痛，血痢，恶疮。\""}]},{"ID":"20240607130512-19q2kk6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607130512-19q2kk6","updated":"20240607130512"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"用法用量"}]},{"ID":"20240607130512-f2gi3mg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607130512-f2gi3mg","updated":"20240607130512"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 内服：煎汤，2～5钱；或入丸、散。外用：煎水洗。"}]},{"ID":"20240607130512-r6ir2hq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607130512-r6ir2hq","updated":"20240607130512"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"复方"}]},{"ID":"20240607130512-ppe7oyy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607130512-ppe7oyy","updated":"20240607130512"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" ①治阳虚气弱，小便不利：野台参四钱，威灵仙钱半，寸麦冬六钱（带心），地肤子一钱。煎服。（《医学衷中参西录》宣阳汤）"}]},{"ID":"20240607130512-85pupag","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607130512-85pupag","updated":"20240607130512"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②治阴虚血亏，小便不利：怀熟地一两，生龟板五钱（捣碎），生杭芍五钱，地肤子一钱。煎服。（《医学衷中参西录》济阴汤）"}]},{"ID":"20240607130512-qcfepja","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607130512-qcfepja","updated":"20240607130512"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③治妊娠患淋，小便数，去少，忽热痛酸索，手足疼烦：地肤子十二两，初以水四升，煎取二升半，分温三服。（《子母秘录》）"}]},{"ID":"20240607130512-sjpwsz4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607130512-sjpwsz4","updated":"20240607130512"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"④治久血痢，日夜不止：地肤子一两，地榆三分（锉），黄芩三分。上药拇细罗为散。每服，不计时候，以粥饮调下二钱。（《圣惠方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240607130512-qkp88q1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607130512-qkp88q1","updated":"20240607130512"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑤治目痛及眯忽中伤，因有热瞑者：取地肤子白汁注目中。（《僧深集方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240607130512-u4jvog8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607130512-u4jvog8","updated":"20240607130512"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑥治雀目：地肤子五两，决明子一升。上二味捣筛，米饮和丸。每食后，以饮服二十丸至三十丸。（《广济方》地肤子丸）"}]},{"ID":"20240607130512-lzjpjqu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607130512-lzjpjqu","updated":"20240607130512"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑦治肝虚目昏：地肤子一斤（阴干，捣罗为末），生地黄五斤（净汤捣，绞取汁）。上药相拌，日中曝干，捣细罗为散。每服，空心以温酒调下二钱，夜临卧，以温水调再服之。（《圣惠方》地肤子散）"}]},{"ID":"20240607130512-9hf53ka","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607130512-9hf53ka","updated":"20240607130512"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑧治胁痛，积年久痛，有时发动：六、七月取地肤子，阴干，末。服方寸匕，日五、六服。（《补缺肘后方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240607130512-4xd4r64","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607130512-4xd4r64","updated":"20240607130512"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑨治跳跃举重，卒得阴颓：白术五分，地肤子十分，桂心三分。上三物，捣末。服一刀圭，日三。（《肘后方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240607130512-bjbva4f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607130512-bjbva4f","updated":"20240607130512"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑩治疝气：地肤子炒香，研末，每服一钱，酒下。（《简便单方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240607130512-bzt841y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607130512-bzt841y","updated":"20240607130512"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑾治痔疾：地肤子不拘多少，新瓦上焙干，捣罗为散。每服三钱匕，用陈粟米饮调下，日三。（《圣济总录》地肤子散）"}]},{"ID":"20240607130512-e403y0j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607130512-e403y0j","updated":"20240607130512"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑿治吹乳：地肤子为末。每服三钱，热酒冲服，出汗愈。（《经验广集》地肤酒）"}]},{"ID":"20240607130512-duho7oa","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607130512-duho7oa","updated":"20240607130512"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⒀治雷头风肿：地肤子，同生姜研烂，热酒冲服，取汗愈。（《圣济总录》）"}]},{"ID":"20240607130512-gzc8edu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607130512-gzc8edu","updated":"20240607130512"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⒁治肢体疣目：地肤子，白矾等分。煎汤频洗。（《寿域神方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240607130512-jmtaq9k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607130512-jmtaq9k","updated":"20240607130512"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⒂治痈：地肤子、莱菔子各一两。文火煎水，趁热洗患处，每日二次，每次10～15分钟。（内蒙古《中草药新医疗法资料选编》）"}]},{"ID":"20240607130512-z2omhfn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607130512-z2omhfn","updated":"20240607130512"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（16）风热赤眼。有地肤子一升（焙）、生地半斤取汁，共用饼，晒干，研细。每服三钱，空心服，酒送下。"}]},{"ID":"20240607130512-ry3753e","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607130512-ry3753e","updated":"20240607130512"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（17）目痛、眯目。用地肤子榨汁点眼。"}]},{"ID":"20240607130512-50x8cth","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607130512-50x8cth","updated":"20240607130512"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（18）雷头风（按：此病是头面肿痛、恶寒发热、太似伤寒）。用地肤子同生姜研烂，热酒冲服汗出即愈。"}]},{"ID":"20240607130512-qq969tr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607130512-qq969tr","updated":"20240607130512"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（19）疝气。用地肤子炒后研细。每服一钱，酒送下。"}]},{"ID":"20240607130512-4s24nc8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607130512-4s24nc8","updated":"20240607130512"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（20）血痢不止。用地肤子五两，地榆、黄芩各一两，共研为末。每服一匙，温水调下。"}]},{"ID":"20240607130512-qc2n1f2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607130512-qc2n1f2","updated":"20240607130512"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（21）妊娠患淋。用地肤子十二两，加水四升，煎至二升半，分次服下。"}]},{"ID":"20240607130512-7xypp26","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607130512-7xypp26","updated":"20240607130512"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（22）小便不通。用地肤草榨汁服，或用地肤草一把，加水煎服。"}]},{"ID":"20240607130512-avdwvbv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607130512-avdwvbv","updated":"20240607130512"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（23）眼睛受伤陷下。弩肉突出。用地肤叶（洗去土）二两，捣烂榨汁，每取少许点眼。冬季无鲜叶，取干叶煮成浓汁亦可。"}]},{"ID":"20240607130512-lxw0ps2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607130512-lxw0ps2","updated":"20240607130512"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"备注"}]},{"ID":"20240607130512-8fkw6i1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607130512-8fkw6i1","updated":"20240607130512"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 地肤于除上述品种外，尚有同属植物扫帚菜（东北）；碱地肤（东北、陕西）的胞果，亦同等入药。其药材外形几无区别。"}]},{"ID":"20240607130512-sdu1a4w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607130512-sdu1a4w","updated":"20240607130512"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"华东以及湖南、湖北、贵州、山东等地，以同科植物藜的胞果，俗称\"灰菜子\"，作地肤子使用。藜的胞果呈钝三角球形，稍压扁，径约1毫米；草绿色至暗绿色，花被紧抱果实，周围无膜质小翅，基部有短果柄，隆线5条。种子扁平圆球形，有光泽，上有放射状排列的线状花纹。气味与地肤子相同。参见\"藜\"条。"}]},{"ID":"20240607130512-cfhl7a8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607130512-cfhl7a8","updated":"20240607130512"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"摘录"}]},{"ID":"20240607130512-pkiq0ej","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607130512-pkiq0ej","updated":"20240607130512"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《中药大辞典》"}]},{"ID":"20240607130512-rhxyptu","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240607130512-rhxyptu","updated":"20240607130512"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《中华本草》：地肤子"}]},{"ID":"20240607130512-gn28ydz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607130512-gn28ydz","updated":"20240607130512"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拼音注音"}]},{"ID":"20240607130512-ospdv0k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607130512-ospdv0k","updated":"20240607130512"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Dì Fū Zǐ"}]},{"ID":"20240607130512-onfjkmo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607130512-onfjkmo","updated":"20240607130512"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"别名"}]},{"ID":"20240607130512-hamivsz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607130512-hamivsz","updated":"20240607130512"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 地葵、地麦、落帚子、，独扫子、竹帚子、千头子、帚菜子、铁扫把子、扫帚子"}]},{"ID":"20240607130512-4dnvyoo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607130512-4dnvyoo","updated":"20240607130512"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"出处"}]},{"ID":"20240607130512-bf4k1u7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607130512-bf4k1u7","updated":"20240607130512"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 出自《神农本草经》"}]},{"ID":"20240607130512-alhmthy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607130512-alhmthy","updated":"20240607130512"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"来源"}]},{"ID":"20240607130512-jbqx8r7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607130512-jbqx8r7","updated":"20240607130512"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 药材基源：为藜科植物地肤的成熟果实。"}]},{"ID":"20240607130512-01hjpg0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607130512-01hjpg0","updated":"20240607130512"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拉丁植物动物矿物名：Kochia scparia（L．） Schrad[Chenopodi－um scopariumL.」"}]},{"ID":"20240607130512-m9wphb0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607130512-m9wphb0","updated":"20240607130512"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"采收和储藏：秋季割取全草，晒干，打下果实，除去杂质，备用。"}]},{"ID":"20240607130512-l962j7y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607130512-l962j7y","updated":"20240607130512"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生境分布"}]},{"ID":"20240607130512-4huynd8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607130512-4huynd8","updated":"20240607130512"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 生态环境：生于荒野、田边、路旁，栽培于庭园。"}]},{"ID":"20240607130512-dyoy7bp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607130512-dyoy7bp","updated":"20240607130512"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"资源分布：几遍布全国。"}]},{"ID":"20240607130512-oqjl31j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607130512-oqjl31j","updated":"20240607130512"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"原形态"}]},{"ID":"20240607130512-ji9j2va","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607130512-ji9j2va","updated":"20240607130512"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 一年生草本，高约50-150cm。茎直立，多分枝，淡绿色或浅红色，生短柔毛。叶互生；无柄；叶片狭披针形或线状披针形，长2-7cm，宽3-7mm，先端短渐尖，基部楔形，全缘，上面绿色无毛，下面淡绿色，无毛或有短柔毛；通常有3条主脉；茎上部叶较小，有一中脉。花单个或2个生于叶腋，集成稀疏的穗状花序；花下有时有锈色长柔毛；花小，两性或雌性；黄绿色，花被片5，近球形，基部合生，果期背部生三角状横突起或翅，有时近扇形；雄蕊5，花丝丝状；花柱极短，柱头2，丝状。胞果扁球形，果皮与种子离生，包于花被内。种子1颗，扁球形，黑褐色。花期6-9月，果期8-10月。"}]},{"ID":"20240607130512-0n84bav","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607130512-0n84bav","updated":"20240607130512"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"栽培"}]},{"ID":"20240607130512-qpjarkj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607130512-qpjarkj","updated":"20240607130512"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 生物学特性 喜温暖湿润气候，耐旱，喜向阳。以选向阳、富含腐殖质、排水良好的壤上栽培为宜。"}]},{"ID":"20240607130512-r526e1j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607130512-r526e1j","updated":"20240607130512"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"栽培技术 用种子繁殖，春季播种，直播或育苗移载，行株距各约50cm，每1hm2用种量7．5～15kg。"}]},{"ID":"20240607130512-b7cs8vz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607130512-b7cs8vz","updated":"20240607130512"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"田间管理 生长期中耕除草、追肥2次。"}]},{"ID":"20240607130512-ijhpnws","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607130512-ijhpnws","updated":"20240607130512"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"病虫害防治 虫害有地老虎，可用毒饵诱杀或人工捕杀。"}]},{"ID":"20240607130512-1h38cud","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607130512-1h38cud","updated":"20240607130512"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性状"}]},{"ID":"20240607130512-0yi2jqd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607130512-0yi2jqd","updated":"20240607130512"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 性状鉴别 胞果扁球状五角星形，直径1-3mm，外被宿存花被。表面灰绿色或淡棕色，周围具三角形膜质小翅5枚，背面中心有突起的点状果梗痕及放射状脉纹5-10条，剥离花被后，可见膜质果皮，半透明；种子扁卵形，长约1mm，黑色。无臭，味微苦。"}]},{"ID":"20240607130512-uzdi4yx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607130512-uzdi4yx","updated":"20240607130512"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"以饱满，色灰绿者为佳。"}]},{"ID":"20240607130512-zxxlfnx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607130512-zxxlfnx","updated":"20240607130512"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"显微鉴别 果实（除去花被）纵切面：果皮细胞1-2列，细胞内充满细小方晶。种皮细胞1-2列，黄棕色。外胚乳菲薄，胚乳位于马蹄状胚的中心，含微细淀粉粒。"}]},{"ID":"20240607130512-v7g0yra","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607130512-v7g0yra","updated":"20240607130512"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"粉末（包括宿存花被）特征：灰绿色或黄褐色。①非腺毛由2-3个细胞组成，有的具壁疣。②石细胞壁稍厚，纹孔稀少；有的石细胞呈短纤维状，长65-150μm，壁较厚，木化。③花被裂片表皮细胞表面观呈多角形；气孔类圆形，黄棕色，不定式，副卫细胞4-5个。④果皮细胞垂周壁略呈波状弯曲，细胞内充满小方晶．盲径3-13m．偶见簇晶。⑤种皮细胞黄棕色，略呈现长方形或方形。理化鉴别（1）取本品粉末0．5g置试管中，加蒸馏水10ml，温浸10min，滤过。滤液置试管中用力振摇，产生持久性泡沫，放置10min泡沫消失不明显。（检查皂甙）（2）取本品粉末10g，加15％硫酸30ml，以100ml氯仿提取。取氯仿提取液5ml，置蒸发皿中蒸干，滴加三氯化锑的氯仿饱和溶液后，则显棕紫色。（检查甾萜类）（3）取本品的甲醇浸出液2ml，加浓盐酸4-5滴及镁粉少许，于水浴上加热2min则显淡红色。（检查黄酮类）本品粉末10g,加酸性水温浸30min，分别取滤液2ml置4支试管中，分别滴加碘化铋钾试剂，碘一碘化钾试剂，硅钨酸试剂，碘化汞钾试剂，均产生沉淀。（检查生物碱）（5）薄层色谱 取本品粉末10g,置圆底烧瓶中，加15％硫酸30ml，氯仿100ml，回流水解2h,滤过。滤液分出氯仿层，回收氯仿，定容至10ml，作为供试品溶液。另取齐墩果酸对照品少许，加乙醇溶解后作为对照品溶液。分别吸取供试品溶液和对照品溶液点样于同一硅胶G（上海荧光化学厂）薄层板。用氯仿-丙酮-环己烷（2：1：7）展开。取出晾干，喷5％磷钼酸的乙醇试液，加热后，供试品溶液色谱在与对照品溶液色谱的相应位置上，显相同的蓝色斑点。"}]},{"ID":"20240607130512-ptoz6za","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607130512-ptoz6za","updated":"20240607130512"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"化学成分"}]},{"ID":"20240607130512-ybdbfjx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607130512-ybdbfjx","updated":"20240607130512"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 果实主含三萜及其甙，已分离得到：齐墩果酸（oleanolic acid），3－O-[β-D-吡喃木糖基（1→3）β-D-吡喃葡萄糖醛酸基]齐墩果酸"}]},{"ID":"20240607130512-31hv036","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607130512-31hv036","updated":"20240607130512"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"药理作用"}]},{"ID":"20240607130512-vg41a9f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607130512-vg41a9f","updated":"20240607130512"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 1.抑菌：水浸剂(1：3)在试管内对许兰氏黄癣菌，奥社盎氏小芽胞癣菌等皮肤真菌有抑制作用。水浸液用试管稀释法，1：3对许兰黄癣菌、奥杜盎小孢子菌及星形奴卡菌等均有抑制作用。抑菌作用水浸剂(1：3)在试管中对许兰氏黄癣菌，奥杜盎氏小芽孢癣菌，铁锈色小芽孢癣菌，羊毛样小芽孢癣菌等皮肤真菌均有程度不同的抑菌作用。50%煎剂用干板挖沟法，对伤寒杆菌有较弱的抑制作用。"}]},{"ID":"20240607130512-gab8jn1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607130512-gab8jn1","updated":"20240607130512"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.抑制过敏：地肤子水提物对小鼠单核巨噬细胞系统及迟发型超敏反应有抑制作用。"}]},{"ID":"20240607130512-zin43xy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607130512-zin43xy","updated":"20240607130512"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"归经"}]},{"ID":"20240607130512-brl167x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607130512-brl167x","updated":"20240607130512"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 肾;膀胱经"}]},{"ID":"20240607130512-x2fmqg2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607130512-x2fmqg2","updated":"20240607130512"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性味"}]},{"ID":"20240607130512-kxalp3d","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607130512-kxalp3d","updated":"20240607130512"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 苦;性寒"}]},{"ID":"20240607130512-ysw0u2e","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607130512-ysw0u2e","updated":"20240607130512"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"注意"}]},{"ID":"20240607130512-exdd7qq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607130512-exdd7qq","updated":"20240607130512"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《本草备要》：恶螵蛸。"}]},{"ID":"20240607130512-x4lnobt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607130512-x4lnobt","updated":"20240607130512"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"功能主治"}]},{"ID":"20240607130512-8qf1m0i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607130512-8qf1m0i","updated":"20240607130512"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 清热利湿；法风止痒。主小便不利；淋浊；带下；血痢；风疹；湿疹；疥癣；皮肤瘙痒；疮毒"}]},{"ID":"20240607130512-eksl00r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607130512-eksl00r","updated":"20240607130512"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"用法用量"}]},{"ID":"20240607130512-706vfta","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607130512-706vfta","updated":"20240607130512"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 内服：煎汤，6～15g；或入丸、散。外用：适量，煎水洗。"}]},{"ID":"20240607130512-bev6v1s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607130512-bev6v1s","updated":"20240607130512"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"各家论述"}]},{"ID":"20240607130512-33hvif7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607130512-33hvif7","updated":"20240607130512"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 1.卢复：地肤之功，上治头而聪耳明目，下入膀胱而利水去疝，外去皮肤热气而令润泽。服之病去，必小水通长为外征也。"}]},{"ID":"20240607130512-ozwg9ov","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607130512-ozwg9ov","updated":"20240607130512"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.《本草述》：地肤之味，始微甘而后纯苦，且其气寒，应属清热之剂。每见用之者或假酒力，或不须酒。愚谓清热则酒可不用，如用之起阴达阳，则宜以火酒浸一日夜，于饭上蒸透，晒干以去其寒性，乃为得之。"}]},{"ID":"20240607130512-3ahu0c5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607130512-3ahu0c5","updated":"20240607130512"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.《本草求真》：地肤子，治淋利水，清热，功颇类于黄柏。但黄柏其味苦烈，此则味苦而甘，黄柏大泻膀胱湿热，此则其力稍逊。凡小便因热而见频数，及或不禁，用此苦以入阴，寒以胜热，而使湿热尽从小便而出也。但虚火偏旺，而热得恣，固当用以清利，若不佐以补味同入，则小水既利而血益虚，血虚则热益生，热生则淋益甚矣。故宜佐以牡蛎、山药、五味收涩之剂，俾清者清，补者补，通者通，涩者涩，滋润条达而无偏胜为害之弊矣。且能以治因热？疝，并煎汤以治疮疥。至书所谓益精强阴，非真具有补益之能，不过因其热除，而即具有坚强之意耳。"}]},{"ID":"20240607130512-mnlipnc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607130512-mnlipnc","updated":"20240607130512"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4.《本草求原》：地肤子，清利膀胱邪热，补膀胱阴血，热去则小便利，中焦之阴气自受益，而耳目聪明矣。故有阴火而小便不禁，尿数或淋疝，客热丹毒并治，为末酒服治白带，同白蔹为丸治白浊。"}]},{"ID":"20240607130512-m5uli7n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607130512-m5uli7n","updated":"20240607130512"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5.《本草正义》:地肤子，苦寒泄热，止有清导湿热，通泄小便之用。《本经》又谓其补中益精气，《别录》称其强阴者，乃湿热不扰而阴精自安之意，断不可拘泥字面，认为补益之品。6.《本经》：主膀胱热，利小便。补中，益精气。"}]},{"ID":"20240607130512-w2d5cjb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607130512-w2d5cjb","updated":"20240607130512"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"7.《别录》：去皮肤中热气，散恶疮，疝瘕，强阴，使人润泽。"}]},{"ID":"20240607130512-fyrvo18","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607130512-fyrvo18","updated":"20240607130512"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"8.《药性论》：与阳起石同服，主丈夫阴痿不起，补气益力；治阴卵？疾，去热风，可作汤沐浴。"}]},{"ID":"20240607130512-o71rlkx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607130512-o71rlkx","updated":"20240607130512"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"9.《日华子本草》：治客热丹肿。"}]},{"ID":"20240607130512-86mzryh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607130512-86mzryh","updated":"20240607130512"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"10.《滇南本草》：利膀胱小便积热，洗皮肤之风，疗妇人诸经客热，清利胎热，湿热带下。11.《本草原始》：去皮肤中积热，除皮肤外湿痒。《本草备要》：益精强阴，除虚热，利小便而通淋。"}]},{"ID":"20240607130512-biypsqd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607130512-biypsqd","updated":"20240607130512"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"12.《玉楸药解》：疗头目肿痛，狐疝阴？，腰疼胁痛，血痢，恶疮。"}]},{"ID":"20240607130512-qtuzmcx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607130512-qtuzmcx","updated":"20240607130512"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"摘录"}]},{"ID":"20240607130512-ivj0ldg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607130512-ivj0ldg","updated":"20240607130512"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《中华本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240607130514-39d69l2","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240607130514-39d69l2"}},{"ID":"20240607130515-vcd36q0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607130515-vcd36q0"}}]}